# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# Intentionally empty. Cloudflare Pages auto-serves `index.html` on any path
# that doesn't match a static file when `index.html` exists at the build output
# root, so the previous `/* /index.html 200` rule was redundant and ignored.
#
# API calls go to `functions.printyx.net` via VITE_API_BASE_URL (see client/src/lib/config.ts)
# — they don't need rewrite rules here.
#
# Add explicit rules below ONLY if you need to override the defaults (e.g.,
# permanent redirects for deprecated URLs). Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom.
